@@ SQLITE HELP · 70x22 · mouse
 ktask-dev  / project   SQLite · real tasks
╭ Keyboard help ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Changes save immediately. r runs the current task in a background   │
│supervisor; p pauses it.                                            │
│r on a paused task resumes the same attempt; on a failed task it    │
│retries, keeping the code and restarting the limits.                │
│s Stop returns any live task to Pending and stashes its uncommitted │
│changes; the next Run starts fresh. T Restart also starts it again  │
│from current HEAD.                                                  │
│D marks any unfinished task done. Pending tasks can be cancelled    │
│(x) or superseded (R); History offers C Copy to queue.              │
│Checks gate every result; review and validation judge it once the   │
│checks pass.                                                        │
│0 Projects lists every project of this instance; Enter opens one,   │
│and each keeps its own queue and background runner. There m points  │
│a project at another folder and D deletes one permanently.          │
│Wheel / PgUp / PgDn: scroll · Esc: close                            │
│                                                                    │
│[Copy] [Close] [Up] [Down]                                          │
│                                                                    │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
